<!-- cell: markdown id="50ae25b4-5a5a-49d8-a3a9-327610868b10" -->

It was a sunny Sunday afternoon.
Bob wandered into a cafe. Alice had already been waiting for him there by the table. He smiled.

<!-- cell: salient-concept id="b9d6b089-18a1-4ea4-b160-71f88277dc4d" title="Alice" words="11-21" -->

Alice is a woman with whom Ben is in love with

<!-- cell: salient-concept id="e2397882-9919-4124-9407-193b0319291b" title="Ben" words="6-10, 22-23" -->

Ben is a boy who's in love with Alice
